  "update_count": 40,
  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \n  \nThe use of an uninitialized value in SkPathMeasure::distanceToSegment may lead to an out-of-bounds array access in SkPathMeasure::getSegment. This may result in bogus SkPoint structures being provided to SkPathMeasure_segTo, possibly leading to an exploitable state."
